course: dictionary
lesson: 345
title: Words from one subject
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words belong to one subject, and annunciation is one of them. It is a church word, so you will meet it mostly in Bible stories, church calendars and art. «The angel Gabriel told Mary in Nazareth that she would have a son, Jesus, the Son of God; this is called the Annunciation.» The clue is in the sentence: an angel brings Mary a message, so annunciation must mean a special message being told.
explain: Look at the word's family. Annunciation is related to announce, which means to tell people something important. The capital letter and the word «the» show that this is one special event, not any old announcement. Test your meaning by swapping in «the message» and checking that the sentence still makes sense.
explain: The word has three meanings, and context chooses the right one. In a Bible story it means the event with the angel. In a church calendar it means the feast that remembers that event. In a formal or rare sentence it can simply mean an announcement. Always read the words around it first.
fact: Annunciation means the announcing: in the Bible, the angel Gabriel told Mary she would be the mother of Jesus.
fact: The Annunciation is also a church feast that remembers this Bible event.
fact: Many famous paintings are called «The Annunciation», because artists painted this Bible story.
fact: In a formal or rare sense, an annunciation is simply an announcement.
fact: Context tells you which meaning is right: an angel, a church calendar or a painting points to the Bible meaning.
exercise: «The angel Gabriel told Mary she would have a son.» In this sentence, what is the Annunciation? | A type of church bell | *The angel's message to Mary about her son | A school trip to Nazareth | A gift of bread from the village
exercise: Ella sees a painting called «The Annunciation» in a museum. What is it probably showing? | A family having dinner at the seaside | *The angel Gabriel bringing Mary a message | A map of Scotland | A busy football match
exercise: Which word is the best clue that the Annunciation is a Bible event? | *angel | bicycle | pen | breakfast
test: «The church calendar marked the Annunciation, a day to remember Mary's news.» What does the Annunciation mean here? | *A church feast that remembers the angel's message | A school sports day | A sale in the church shop | A map of the church garden
test: Nadia reads «The mayor's annunciation of the new park surprised everyone.» Which meaning fits best? | A painting of a park | *An announcement | A church feast in spring | A Bible story about an angel
exam: Jayden asks: what is the best way to work out the meaning of annunciation in a new text? | Skip it and never read that part again | Look only at the first letter | *Read the words around it and check which meaning fits | Guess that it is a type of food
